            "descriptionRaw": "<color=#FFD780FF>Normal Attack</color>\nPerforms up to 5 consecutive spear strikes.\n\n<color=#FFD780FF>Charged Attack</color>\nConsumes a certain amount of Stamina to lunge forward, dealing damage to opponents along the way.\n\n<color=#FFD780FF>Plunging Attack</color>\nPlunges from mid-air to strike the ground below, damaging opponents along the path and dealing AoE DMG upon impact.",
            "id": 10451,
            "name": "Spear of the Church",
            "proudSkillGroupId": 4531
        },
