            "descriptionRaw": "Rosaria swiftly shifts her position to appear behind her opponent, then stabs and slashes them with her polearm, dealing <color=#99FFFFFF>Cryo DMG</color>.\nThis ability cannot be used to travel behind opponents of a larger build.\n\n<i>Those who confess to Sister Rosaria will be granted no absolution. All sinners shall be met with the piercing cold of punishment proportionate to the weight of their sins.</i>",
            "id": 10452,
            "name": "Ravaging Confession",
            "proudSkillGroupId": 4532
        },
